OL,3,AUS and Denmark reach deal over
OL,4,AGreenland after Trump annexation
OL,5,Athreats
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US and Denmark have announced a
OL,8,Fdeal on Greenland's security, resolving
OL,9,Fa diplomatic dispute sparked by
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump's threats to
OL,11,Fseize the territory by force.
OL,13,FTrump said the agreement would grant
OL,14,Fthe US "permanent control over
OL,15,Fsecurity, and all other needs".
OL,17,FDenmark's Prime Minister said the deal
OL,18,F"strengthens security in the Arctic and
OL,19,Fthe North Atlantic area" but did not
OL,20,Faddress specifics in the agreement that
OL,21,FTrump mentioned in a social media post.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
