OL,3,AUS and Denmark reach deal over
OL,4,AGreenland after Trump annexation
OL,5,Athreats
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe deal comes after months of threats
OL,8,Fby Trump to "take" Greenland, which is
OL,9,Fa semi-autonomous Danish territory,
OL,10,Fover national security concerns -
OL,11,Fciting its strategic location for
OL,12,Fdefence purposes and its mineral
OL,13,Fwealth.
